 & Feedback:**\n\nEnjoying HM HUB? Drop a like or share with friends!  \nFound a bug or have a suggestion? Let me know — your feedback shapes the next update!\n\n---\n\n🎯 **HM HUB — Play Smarter. Hunt Better. Win Always.**\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Short Version (for quick copy-paste):\n\n```\n🔥 HM HUB — Ultimate All-in-One Script for Slasher Games!\n✅ Generator ESP + Auto Repair + Teleport\n✅ Survivor/Killer ESP\n✅ Smart Hitbox Killer (Point & Kill)\n✅ Auto Carry, Auto Grab, Auto Hook\n✅ Anti-Stun + Anti-Shake\n✅ Clean Orion UI — Easy to Use!\n📥 Paste in Executor & Dominate!\n``","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hamozdz/HM-HUB-Violence-District-BETA/refs/heads/main/Protected_7912138782446260.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"67f409b5497c029fb30a86db","username":"HMHUB","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7b64d527f1326e0bff166eb4b0a7553156fd7d07000af140b3648716c8eeaede.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67f409b5497c029fb30a86db-1757674569879.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"67f409b5497c029fb30a86db","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7b64d527f1326e0bff166eb4b0a7553156fd7d07000af140b3648716c8eeaede.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67f409b5497c029fb30a86db-1757674569879.jpg"}},"verified":false,"views":26291,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/ab04b3b2a2c8bf8511f1a87506f85c56233c60db1f0f216e4584635f59b6c89c.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/93978595733734-1758018294994.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/93978595733734-1758018294994.jpg"},"likeCount":6,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-09-16T10:24:55.014Z","discord":"https://discord.gg/QbgfnX2a6z","executes":4095,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0